  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C036.signal_basis",
    "value": "Make attachment responsibility explicit and compare missing-attachment frequency across comparable orders at consistent inspection intervals. A repeated reduction is the proposed signal; other workflow conditions are held unchanged where feasible and concurrent changes logged, but temporal association cannot exclude alternative causes.",
